51:["$","p",null,{"children":"Treat it as guidance with real limits: unusual demand, group cancellations, quota changes, or last-minute operational decisions can all push the actual outcome away from the estimate. If the probability looks weak, it is worth exploring alternative trains or a split journey rather than waiting on the waitlist alone."}]
52:["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-4","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-xl font-black text-main","children":"PNR status — frequently asked questions"}],["$","dl",null,{"className":"space-y-5","children":[["$","div","What is PNR status?",{"className":"space-y-1.5","children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"text-sm font-bold text-main","children":"What is PNR status?"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"text-sm text-secondary leading-relaxed","children":"PNR status is the current booking state of a railway ticket, identified by a 10-digit PNR number printed on the ticket or sent in the booking confirmation. It shows whether each passenger is confirmed, in RAC, or still on the waitlist, along with coach and berth details once they are allotted."}]]}],["$","div","How do I check my PNR status on Trayago?",{"className":"space-y-1.5","children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"text-sm font-bold text-main","children":"How do I check my PNR status on Trayago?"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"text-sm text-secondary leading-relaxed","children":"Enter your 10-digit PNR number in the field at the top of this page and select Check Status. Trayago retrieves the latest booking status for that PNR and displays passenger-wise details, chart preparation state, and a confirmation probability estimate where one can be computed. No account or login is required, and checking PNR status is free."}]]}],["$","div","What does CNF mean on a PNR status?",{"className":"space-y-1.5","children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"text-sm font-bold text-main","children":"What does CNF mean on a PNR status?"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"text-sm text-secondary leading-relaxed","children":"CNF means confirmed. The passenger has a reserved berth or seat for the journey. Once the reservation chart is prepared, the coach and berth number are shown alongside the CNF status."}]]}],["$","div","What does RAC mean on a PNR status?",{"className":"space-y-1.5","children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"text-sm font-bold text-main","children":"What does RAC mean on a PNR status?"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"text-sm text-secondary leading-relaxed","children":"RAC stands for Reservation Against Cancellation. An RAC passenger may board the train and is allotted a shared side-lower berth, typically with two passengers sharing one berth. RAC tickets can move to confirmed if berths become free before or after chart preparation."}]]}],["$","div","What does WL mean on a PNR status?",{"className":"space-y-1.5","children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"text-sm font-bold text-main","children":"What does WL mean on a PNR status?"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"text-sm text-secondary leading-relaxed","children":"WL means waitlist. The ticket has no berth allotted yet and its position in the queue is shown as a number, for example GNWL 12 or PQWL 5. Waitlisted tickets move up as other passengers cancel. A ticket that is still waitlisted after the final chart is prepared is generally not valid for travel in a reserved coach."}]]}],["$","div","What is chart preparation?",{"className":"space-y-1.5","children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"text-sm font-bold text-main","children":"What is chart preparation?"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"text-sm text-secondary leading-relaxed","children":"Chart preparation is the point at which Indian Railways finalises berth allocation for a train, usually a few hours before departure. Trayago shows whether the chart is prepared for your PNR, because status changes are far more likely before this point than after it."}]]}],["$","div","Can my PNR status change after booking?",{"className":"space-y-1.5","children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"text-sm font-bold text-main","children":"Can my PNR status change after booking?"}],"$L56"]}],"$L57","$L58","$L59"]}]]}]
