56:["$","dd",null,{"className":"text-sm text-secondary leading-relaxed","children":"Yes. A waitlisted or RAC ticket can move towards confirmation as other passengers cancel, and berth or coach allocation can change when the chart is prepared. Checking your PNR status again closer to departure is the reliable way to see the current position."}]
57:["$","div","How does Trayago's PNR confirmation prediction work?",{"className":"space-y-1.5","children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"text-sm font-bold text-main","children":"How does Trayago's PNR confirmation prediction work?"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"text-sm text-secondary leading-relaxed","children":"Trayago compares your current waitlist position against historical booking and cancellation trends for the same train, class, quota, and route, along with factors such as travel date and seasonality. The result is expressed as a confirmation probability. It is a statistical estimate, not a decision by Indian Railways, and unusual demand or last-minute changes can make the actual outcome differ."}]]}]
58:["$","div","Does Trayago guarantee confirmed tickets?",{"className":"space-y-1.5","children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"text-sm font-bold text-main","children":"Does Trayago guarantee confirmed tickets?"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"text-sm text-secondary leading-relaxed","children":"No. Trayago provides journey intelligence, status information, and probability estimates to help you plan. Only Indian Railways allots berths, and no confirmation can be guaranteed by Trayago."}]]}]
59:["$","div","Is Trayago affiliated with IRCTC?",{"className":"space-y-1.5","children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"text-sm font-bold text-main","children":"Is Trayago affiliated with IRCTC?"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"text-sm text-secondary leading-relaxed","children":"No. Trayago is an independent travel intelligence platform and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or operated by IRCTC or Indian Railways. Ticket booking is completed through official booking platforms."}]]}]
